      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Results of therapy with laser (separate and associated with essentiale) applied to patients with stable stenocardia of II and III functional classes evidence that both methods suppress lipid peroxidation and promote antioxidant protection of erythrocyte membranes thus influencing beneficially the course of the disease. Laser combined with essentiale results in especially pronounced deactivation of lipid peroxidation."},
